### 需求模块完整测试流程

### 1. 登录获取Token（使用你提供的正确格式）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    // 保存Token到全局变量
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data);
    console.log("✅ 登录成功，Token已保存:", client.global.get("auth_token"));
%}

### 2. 发布第一个需求
POST http://localhost:8080/demand/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "急需Python数据分析辅导",
  "category": "学习辅导",
  "tags": "Python,数据分析,Pandas",
  "description": "我需要学习Python数据分析，特别是Pandas库的使用，希望有经验的学长能帮忙辅导",
  "expectedPrice": 80.00,
  "expectedDuration": 3,
  "expectedLocation": "线上会议",
  "contactPhone": "13800138001"
}

### 3. 发布第二个需求（不同分类）
POST http://localhost:8080/demand/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "需要PS修图帮助",
  "category": "设计制作",
  "tags": "Photoshop,修图,设计",
  "description": "毕业照需要修图，希望找会PS的同学帮忙",
  "expectedPrice": 30.00,
  "expectedDuration": 1,
  "expectedLocation": "线上",
  "contactPhone": "13800138001"
}

### 4. 获取我的需求列表
GET http://localhost:8080/demand/my
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5. 测试空字段发布（最小信息）
POST http://localhost:8080/demand/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "最小信息测试",
  "description": "只包含必要字段的测试"
}